d_fkey`); it is the extraction's \"both shapes answer 404 the same way\".\n37:57:> Activity E (`identity-code-and-qr`, `mms-send-on-signup`) is customer delivery. Two cards are\n55:75-Secondary outcomes the same build delivers: a durable customer identity across visits (one\n56:76-identity code, §10) and a measurable repeat rate.\n67:87-1. **A real redemption, end-to-end.** The operator issues one test identity code, receives it as\n96:250:| 10 | QR payload shape | **Resolved (operator, this round):** URL-wrapping the identity token (→ full server-side entitlements when online) **plus an embedded offer descriptor** for offline viewing — hybrid; locked at Activity E |\n131:285-- `external-accounts-provision` · **PLANNED** · Attended (operator holds accounts/billing).\n182:624:## Activity E — Customer delivery (one identity code → QR → image)\n191:633-> `.night-crew/knowledge/spikes/activity-e-customer-delivery-one-identity-code-qr-image/`. The\n195:637-### identity-code-and-qr\n197:639-- `identity-code-and-qr` · **PLANNED** · **One permanent identity code per customer** — the","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
